title: "tomorrow_never_dies — CARVER: Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic mission-software package modeling disinformation propagation,
  stealth-vessel (low-RCS) detection, and GPS-denial impact for Tomorrow Never
  Dies (1997). Part of the PROJECT BOND suite and interoperates through the
  FROZEN bond_api MissionProvider protocol (codename THE PROTOCOL).
